c7d-500a-9345-03bd6b73a333" :question/math-academy-id "e-465" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $$\n\\displaystyle\\int 5 \\csc {\\left(6x+\\dfrac \\pi 3\\right)} \\cot {\\left(6x+\\dfrac \\pi 3\\right)} \\,  \\textrm{d}x.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "If we let $u=6x+\\dfrac \\pi 3,$ then\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d x} = 6\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm d x =\\dfrac 1 6\\, \\textrm d u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 5\\operatorname{csc}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x & =5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡u\\operatorname{cot}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{6}\\int \\operatorname{csc}⁡u\\operatorname{cot}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{6}\\operatorname{csc}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{6}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(6x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "084eb4cc-2f84-5288-90a6-be84066922b6" :knowledge-point/level-coverage [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186682571} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069004} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069006} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186250146} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186269130} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290366} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186319094} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186319363} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186319364} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186429931} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186429933} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553505} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186580882} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186580890} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186580925} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186580927} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186580935} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186601948} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186611583} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186658965} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186677387} {:db/id 